    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 51 Merrion Village, Merrion Road, Ballsbridge, Dublin 4 to the market. Nestled in the prestigious and highly sought-after Merrion Village development in the heart of Ballsbridge, No. 51 offers a rare opportunity to acquire a bright, generously proportioned two-bedroom apartment with a host of attractive features. This well-maintained ground floor property combines comfort, practicality, and an unbeatable location just minutes from Dublin's finest amenities. \n\nThe well laid out accommodation extends to approximately 50sqm / 538sqft and briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, living / dining room, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms with fitted Wardropes and bathroom with shower. No. 51 is further enhanced with the sunny balcony which is the perfect spot for al fresco dining and enjoying sun and natural light throughout the day. \n\nNo. 51 includes a designated parking space, located in a secure, well-managed development surrounded by mature landscaping and meticulously maintained communal areas. Residents of Merrion Village enjoy a quiet, leafy environment with gated access and on-site management, offering peace of mind and convenience. Located just moments from the vibrant villages of Ballsbridge and Sandymount, the area is rich in cafes, restaurants, shops, and transport links. The nearby Dart station, the seafront, and Dublin's central business districts are all within easy reach, making this property ideal for both owner-occupiers and investors alike. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the space, privacy, and superb location this apartment has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Highly Sought After Location Dublin 4 Location</li><li> Secure Gated Development</li><li> Located approximately 5km from Stephen's Green</li><li> Secure Designated Parking Space</li><li> Excellent Home or Investment</li><li> Management Fee is approximately 3,516 per annum.</li><li> C BER Rating</li><li> Large south facing balcony/terrace not overlooked.</li><li> Gas fired central heating</ul>"
      },
